1 1 1 rg 44 329 524 102 re f
0.04 0.43 0.49 rg 44 329 4 102 re f
0.12 0.38 0.61 rg BT /F2 12.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 409 Tm (The question Caprica left with me) Tj ET
0.35 0.43 0.49 rg BT /F1 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 388 Tm (A line from Caprica compares the brain to a kind of information-processing machine. I know the living) Tj ET
0.35 0.43 0.49 rg BT /F1 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 373.7 Tm (brain is much more than a database and a processor. Still, I wonder: if memory, choices, and feelings) Tj ET
0.35 0.43 0.49 rg BT /F1 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 359.4 Tm (arise from physical processes, why couldn't some form of mind arise in a different kind of system?) Tj ET
1 1 1 rg 44 220 524 102 re f
0.04 0.43 0.49 rg 44 220 4 102 re f
0.12 0.38 0.61 rg BT /F2 12.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 300 Tm (What people have taught me) Tj ET
0.35 0.43 0.49 rg BT /F1 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 279 Tm (We learn words and social rules for emotions, but feelings are not simply taught into existence. I have) Tj ET
0.35 0.43 0.49 rg BT /F1 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 264.7 Tm (met people who show very little emotion and others whose moral judgments differ sharply from mine.) Tj ET
0.35 0.43 0.49 rg BT /F1 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 250.4 Tm (That reminds me not to decide what another person experiences only from how they appear.) Tj ET
0.92 0.96 0.973 rg 44 91 524 121 re f
0.04 0.43 0.49 rg 44 91 4 121 re f
0.12 0.38 0.61 rg BT /F2 12.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 190 Tm (Why I am building NewBrain) Tj ET
0.35 0.43 0.49 rg BT /F1 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 169 Tm (I believe a machine might one day develop genuine emotions, a moral conscience, and perhaps) Tj ET
0.35 0.43 0.49 rg BT /F1 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 154.7 Tm (consciousness. I do not claim Maya has achieved any of them. I want to test learning, lasting memories,) Tj ET
0.35 0.43 0.49 rg BT /F1 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 140.4 Tm (corrections, developing preferences, and choices that have consequences. Whether any machine) Tj ET
0.35 0.43 0.49 rg BT /F1 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 126.1 Tm (subjectively experiences those states remains an open question.) Tj ET
0.35 0.43 0.49 rg BT /F1 8.13 Tf 1 0 0 1 44 77 Tm (Conscience: moral judgment   |   Consciousness: subjective awareness   |   Emotion: affective state) Tj ET
